OL,5,G1720 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FDan and Mardi Leonard host at
OL,7,     Ftheir funky Brighton B&B, Guest
OL,8,     Fand the City, where the guests
OL,9,     Fhave mixed reactions to the
OL,10,     Fcontemporary decor and
OL,11,     Fstained-glass windows.
OL,12,G1755 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FAt The Farmer's Boy Inn in
OL,14,     FGloucestershire, pie entrepreneur
OL,15,     FPhil sets his guests a pie-making
OL,16,     Fchallenge. In the morning, the
OL,17,     Fgroup work up an appetite for
OL,18,     Fbreakfast on the bouncy castle.
