OL,5,G1825 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAlan and Jane welcome their
OL,7,     Ffirst-ever guests aboard their
OL,8,     Fbrand-new, purpose-built hotel
OL,9,     Fboat, the Geanna, and pull out all
OL,10,     Fthe stops with a champagne cruise
OL,11,     Falong the Thames.
OL,12,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThere are high hopes for Sarah and
OL,14,     FJean-Pierre's B&B, Sentry Mead.
OL,15,     FThe hosts serve a five-star dinner
OL,16,     Fand breakfast, but Jane feels
OL,17,     Fmugged off and Phil's not keen on
OL,18,     Fthe towels.
