OL,5,G2100 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode explores the notions
OL,7,     Fof luck and chance, when a young
OL,8,     Fman is involved in a high-speed
OL,9,     Fcar crash and an 18-year-old
OL,10,     Fbreaks his leg while playing
OL,11,     Ffootball.
OL,12,G2200 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FThis episode explores the
OL,14,     Fimportance of family. Mike, who's
OL,15,     F79, has collapsed in the street.
OL,16,     FAndrew, who's 53, tripped on a
OL,17,     Fpaving slab and has a suspected
OL,18,     Fdislocated shoulder.
